  "notes": "COMPOUNDS:\n{誰|だれ} (who) + でも (even, any)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\nThe ~でも pattern creates \"any-\" words:\n- {何|なん}でも - anything\n- {何処|どこ}でも - anywhere\n- いつでも - anytime\n- どちらでも - either one\n\nUSAGE:\n- With positive: \"anyone can\" → universal possibility\n- With negative: \"not anyone\" → nobody\n- {誰|だれ}でもいい - anyone is fine (indifference)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {誰|だれ}でも (anyone/everyone) ↔ {誰|だれ}か (someone)\n- {誰|だれ}でも (anyone/everyone) ↔ {誰|だれ}も + neg (no one)",
